WEBVTT

00:03:00.699 --> 00:03:12.699
<font color="#ff00ff" face="Segoe Print">Penerjemah: IbrahimKh</font>

00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:31.520
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Dia bilang 'Selamat pagi,'
dan bertanya 'Bagaimana keadaan tanganmu?'</font>

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:35.188
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Sudah lebih baik.</font>

00:03:35.434 --> 00:03:36.628
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Ada bagian yang lepas.</font>

00:03:39.672 --> 00:03:41.105
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Maaf.</font>

00:03:41.373 --> 00:03:44.137
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Kami ingin berbicara denganmu
jika kau sudah merasa baikan.</font>

00:03:44.343 --> 00:03:46.470
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Ya, baiklah.</font>

00:03:47.980 --> 00:03:51.074
<font face="Trebuchet MS">- Kopi?
- Tidak, terima kasih.</font>

00:03:53.986 --> 00:03:57.353
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Ceritakan tentang tempat
yang kau sebutkan di Slovakia.</font>

00:03:58.657 --> 00:04:00.488
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Itu...</font>

00:04:01.393 --> 00:04:03.258
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Semacam pabrik...</font>

00:04:03.829 --> 00:04:06.297
<font face="Trebuchet MS"><i>...berisi orang-orang yang sangat kaya,</i></font>

00:04:06.499 --> 00:04:09.559
<font face="Trebuchet MS"><i>mereka membayar untuk
menyiksa dan membunuh,</i></font>

00:04:10.102 --> 00:04:11.797
<font face="Trebuchet MS"><i>kebanyakan pelancong.</i></font>

00:04:14.540 --> 00:04:16.872
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Mereka membunuh dua orang temanku.</font>

00:04:32.892 --> 00:04:34.484
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Mereka membawamu dari hostel tersebut...</font>

00:04:35.561 --> 00:04:38.189
<font face="Trebuchet MS"><i>...menuju pabik itu dan...</i></font>

00:04:39.798 --> 00:04:42.562
<font face="Trebuchet MS"><i>Aku ke sana untuk mencari Josh.</i></font>

00:04:42.768 --> 00:04:47.205
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Dia salah satu temanku,
mereka membawanya ke sana dan...</font>

00:04:49.942 --> 00:04:51.773
<font face="Trebuchet MS"><i>dan mereka...</i></font>

00:04:51.977 --> 00:04:52.944
<font face="Trebuchet MS"><i>mereka membunuhnya,</i></font>

00:04:56.615 --> 00:04:58.310
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Itu mengerikan.</font>

00:05:10.095 --> 00:05:11.824
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Dia bertanya bagaimana
kau bisa selamat.</font>

00:05:16.335 --> 00:05:17.302
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Aku...</font>

00:05:26.345 --> 00:05:28.245
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Aku kabur.</font>

00:05:39.158 --> 00:05:41.251
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Siapa yang mengurus tempat tersebut?</font>

00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:46.830
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Entahlah.
Semacam klub pemburu. Mereka...</font>

00:05:47.366 --> 00:05:50.426
<font face="Trebuchet MS">...mereka punya tato yang sama.</font>

00:05:50.636 --> 00:05:51.728
<font face="Trebuchet MS"><i>Seekor anjing.</i></font>

00:05:51.937 --> 00:05:53.461
<font face="Trebuchet MS"><i>Anjing pelacak.</i></font>

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:10.745
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Aneh kau menyebut tato itu.</font>

00:06:12.091 --> 00:06:13.149
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Kenapa?</font>

00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:26.703
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Karena seseorang ditemukan tewas
di kamar mandi stasiun Vienna...</font>

00:06:26.905 --> 00:06:29.305
<font face="Trebuchet MS">...dengan tato anjing pelacak
seperti yang kau paparkan.</font>

00:06:36.682 --> 00:06:40.812
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Rekaman dari stasiun tersebut
menampilkan dia masuk dari balkon...</font>

00:06:41.020 --> 00:06:45.150
<font face="Trebuchet MS">...di mana kereta hari itu
tiba lebih cepat dari Slovakia.</font>

00:06:45.357 --> 00:06:47.848
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Kereta itu melewati
stasiun yang sama di Vienna.</font>

00:06:52.364 --> 00:06:54.332
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Kau ada dalam rekaman tersebut.</font>

00:07:00.172 --> 00:07:03.972
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Apa tatonya terlihat seperti ini?</font>

00:07:04.476 --> 00:07:06.103
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Apa-apaan ini?</font>

00:07:06.312 --> 00:07:08.507
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Tolong! Seseorang tolong aku!</font>

00:07:21.260 --> 00:07:22.386
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Astaga.</font>

00:07:33.939 --> 00:07:35.497
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Kau lapar?</font>

00:07:35.974 --> 00:07:37.999
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Ini baru jam 3 pagi.</font>

00:07:38.210 --> 00:07:40.906
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Aku mau makan ini.
Siapa tahu kau juga mau.</font>

00:07:41.146 --> 00:07:44.047
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Ya, aku mau kamu
ngomong sama seseorang.</font>

00:07:45.050 --> 00:07:47.143
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Kapan kamu mau ngomong ke
Ibu Josh yang sebenarnya terjadi?</font>

00:07:47.353 --> 00:07:48.650
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Aku tidak mau.</font>

00:07:50.989 --> 00:07:52.820
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Dia masih berpikir
kalau anaknya di Eropa.</font>

00:07:53.025 --> 00:07:55.289
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Kenapa harus aku?</font>

00:07:55.494 --> 00:07:58.520
<font face="Trebuchet MS">- Dia akan lapor polisi.
- Ya, tentu. Seseorang harus melakukannya.</font>

00:07:58.731 --> 00:08:02.861
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Tidak. Kau tidak mengerti.
Mereka beraliansi dengan semua orang.</font>

00:08:03.068 --> 00:08:04.501
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Seseorang mulai bertanya...</font>

00:08:04.703 --> 00:08:06.568
<font face="Trebuchet MS">...lalu mereka akan mengejar
dan menangkapku.</font>

00:08:06.972 --> 00:08:10.806
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Di rumah nenekku? Aku bahkan nggak
pernah ke sini lagi sejak kecil.</font>

00:08:11.009 --> 00:08:13.807
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Aku nyaris nggak bisa nemuin tempat ini.
Aku harus nanyain arah pada kakakku.</font>

00:08:14.012 --> 00:08:16.037
<font face="Trebuchet MS">- Kau bilang kakakmu kalau kita di sini?
- Ya, kenapa emangnya?</font>

00:08:16.248 --> 00:08:18.739
<font face="Trebuchet MS">- Siapa saja yang tahu?
- Nggak seorangpun!</font>

00:08:18.951 --> 00:08:20.418
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Astaga.</font>

00:08:21.553 --> 00:08:24.044
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Aku melakukan ini untuk melindungimu.
Kau tahu itu, 'kan?</font>

00:08:24.256 --> 00:08:26.588
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Oh, Paxton...</font>

00:08:28.927 --> 00:08:29.916
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Dengar.</font>

00:08:30.529 --> 00:08:32.929
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Aku ngajak kamu balikan
karena aku ngerasa <i>nggak enak sama kamu</i></font>

00:08:33.465 --> 00:08:35.865
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Tapi kamu malah jadi gila.</font>

00:08:36.068 --> 00:08:39.526
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Kamu bangun tiap malam dan teriak-teriak.
Aku nggak bisa tidur.</font>

00:08:39.738 --> 00:08:41.330
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Baik, itu takkan
jadi masalah lagi.</font>

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:43.167
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Paxton, bukan itu yang--</font>

00:08:44.143 --> 00:08:46.509
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Oh, sial.</font>

00:09:16.842 --> 00:09:18.503
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Pagi!</font>

00:09:37.529 --> 00:09:39.360
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Paxton?</font>

00:09:48.540 --> 00:09:49.768
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Hei.</font>

00:11:09.054 --> 00:11:10.521
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Lorna?</font>

00:11:10.822 --> 00:11:12.380
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Lorna?</font>

00:11:14.693 --> 00:11:18.094
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Maaf. Aku mencoba untuk menghayatinya.</font>

00:11:18.297 --> 00:11:20.265
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Menyerapnya.</font>

00:11:25.637 --> 00:11:28.731
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Menurutmu dia pernah melihat
penis sebelum masuk kelas ini?</font>

00:11:29.041 --> 00:11:31.236
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Kalaupun pernah,
saat di Botticelli.</font>

00:11:31.443 --> 00:11:32.705
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Ya Tuhan.</font>

00:11:32.911 --> 00:11:36.779
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Jika aku mendengar dia bicara
tentang Botticelli sekali lagi...</font>

00:11:36.982 --> 00:11:39.746
<font face="Trebuchet MS">...demi Tuhan,
akan kucekik jalang itu sampai mati.</font>

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:49.991
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Sampai hari Selasa.</font>

00:11:50.195 --> 00:11:51.594
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Kau sudah bersiap ke Praha?</font>

00:11:51.797 --> 00:11:54.197
<font face="Trebuchet MS">- Jeans. Tanpa sepatu berhak.
- Luar biasa.</font>

00:11:54.399 --> 00:11:56.890
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Aku tidak bisa memakainya di bebatuan.
Entah bagaimana kau melakukannya.</font>

00:11:57.102 --> 00:11:59.195
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Akan kuajari asal kau membawa sepatunya.</font>

00:12:04.710 --> 00:12:06.075
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Axelle.</font>

00:12:14.720 --> 00:12:17.951
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Pegang pensil kalian, anak-anak.</font>

00:12:32.638 --> 00:12:34.970
<font face="Trebuchet MS">- Pernahkah dia?
- Permisi, gadis-gadis.</font>

00:12:35.173 --> 00:12:36.470
<font face="Trebuchet MS">- Permisi. Hai.
- Hai.</font>

00:12:36.675 --> 00:12:39.371
<font face="Trebuchet MS">- Boleh kulihat?
- Oh, gambarku kasar.</font>

00:12:39.578 --> 00:12:42.103
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Perlihatkan.
Tidak perlu malu.</font>

00:12:45.717 --> 00:12:47.014
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Ini salah satu gambarmu.</font>

00:12:47.252 --> 00:12:50.619
<font face="Trebuchet MS">- Oh, wow, itu cantik.
- Trims.</font>

00:12:50.822 --> 00:12:52.312
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Berapa kau menghargainya?</font>

00:12:52.524 --> 00:12:54.458
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Aku takkan menjualnya.
Kau bisa memilikinya.</font>

00:12:54.660 --> 00:12:56.150
<font face="Trebuchet MS">- Benarkah?
- Ya.</font>

00:12:56.361 --> 00:12:59.626
<font face="Trebuchet MS">- Ya Tuhan, terima kasih banyak.
- Sama-sama.</font>

00:12:59.831 --> 00:13:02.026
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Mau kubelikan minuman atau lainnya?</font>

00:13:02.234 --> 00:13:05.670
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Oh, aku sudah terlambat. Kami
akan naik kereta ke Praha, tapi...</font>

00:13:05.871 --> 00:13:08.203
<font face="Trebuchet MS">- Entahlah. Mungkin lain waktu.
- Oke.</font>

00:13:08.407 --> 00:13:10.238
<font face="Trebuchet MS">- Ya! Oke.
- Oke.</font>

00:13:10.442 --> 00:13:13.843
<font face="Trebuchet MS">- Sampai jumpa.
- Baiklah. Dah. Trims.</font>

00:13:22.187 --> 00:13:24.519
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Tidak, Ayah. Ini Praha.
Kami akan baik-baik saja.</font>

00:13:24.723 --> 00:13:26.588
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Ini bukan Ukraina.</font>

00:13:29.027 --> 00:13:30.494
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Bukan.</font>

00:13:32.464 --> 00:13:34.796
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Tidak, Ayah,
jangan pesan selama empat musim.</font>

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:36.433
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Pesan saja. Kumohon!</font>

00:13:36.635 --> 00:13:40.594
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Karena, Ayah, tidak ada mahasiswi
yang tinggal selama empat musim.</font>

00:13:40.806 --> 00:13:45.402
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Dan Ayah tahu, ini untuk orang tua.
Jadi trims, tapi tidak usah.</font>

00:13:46.178 --> 00:13:47.543
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Apa?</font>

00:13:50.682 --> 00:13:53.082
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Ya, kami menemukan
yang lebih murah.</font>

00:13:53.285 --> 00:13:55.116
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Oke, aku sayang Ayah. Dah.</font>

00:13:55.587 --> 00:13:58.249
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Astaga, aku benci dia menelepon tiap lima menit.</font>

00:13:58.457 --> 00:14:01.620
<font face="Trebuchet MS">- Baiklah, ayo.
- Tunggu, kita harus menunggu seseorang.</font>

00:14:02.227 --> 00:14:03.558
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Siapa?</font>

00:14:06.665 --> 00:14:07.689
<font face="Trebuchet MS">- Ya.
- Tidak.</font>

00:14:07.899 --> 00:14:08.957
<font face="Trebuchet MS">- Ya.
- Tidak.</font>

00:14:09.167 --> 00:14:11.795
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Dia memojok di apartemen.
Dia kangen rumah, menangis.</font>

00:14:12.003 --> 00:14:13.630
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Aku merasa tidak enak.
Apa yang harus kukatakan?</font>

00:14:13.839 --> 00:14:17.036
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Dia kangen Baltimore?
Astaga, kita di Roma</font>

00:14:17.242 --> 00:14:18.869
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Dia tidak seburuk itu.</font>

00:14:34.993 --> 00:14:37.086
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Wow, apa itu jurnal barumu?</font>

00:14:37.963 --> 00:14:40.090
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Ya, ini jurnal perjalanan.</font>

00:14:40.298 --> 00:14:41.822
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Untuk dikenang suatu saat nanti.</font>

00:14:42.801 --> 00:14:43.995
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Tentu saja.</font>

00:14:45.504 --> 00:14:47.438
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Lorna, kami mau beli minuman.
Kau mau ikut?</font>

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:49.605
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Tidak usah, terima kasih.</font>

00:14:50.509 --> 00:14:53.774
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Baiklah. Kami akan
kembali sebentar lagi. Oke?</font>

00:14:55.347 --> 00:14:56.507
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Santai saja, kawan.</font>

00:14:56.782 --> 00:14:58.306
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Sampai ketemu nanti.</font>

00:15:10.228 --> 00:15:13.129
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Permisi, keparat.</font>

00:15:24.810 --> 00:15:26.471
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Dia seperti nenek
berumur 20 tahun.</font>

00:15:26.678 --> 00:15:28.771
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Terserahlah. Dia mengawasi barang-barang kita.
Dia senang, kok.</font>

00:15:29.147 --> 00:15:31.274
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Itu hobinya.</font>

00:15:31.483 --> 00:15:32.882
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Oh, kami tidak memesan ini.</font>

00:15:33.084 --> 00:15:34.881
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Ini dari seorang gadis.</font>

00:15:38.156 --> 00:15:40.215
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Wah, cewekmu membuntuti kita.</font>

00:15:41.827 --> 00:15:43.522
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Hei, apa yang kau lakukan?</font>

00:15:43.995 --> 00:15:46.156
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Kau menginspirasiku
untuk melakukan perjalanan.</font>

00:15:55.340 --> 00:15:57.001
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Lihat ini.</font>

00:15:59.945 --> 00:16:01.936
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Kau pasti bercanda.</font>

00:16:02.314 --> 00:16:03.576
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Halo, siapa namamu?</font>

00:16:11.623 --> 00:16:15.252
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Kau tahu di mana kami bisa
bersenang-senang? Semacam pesta.</font>

00:16:15.894 --> 00:16:16.986
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Apa yang kau inginkan?</font>

00:16:17.195 --> 00:16:20.358
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Entahlah.
Teman, ekstasi, dan...</font>

00:16:21.867 --> 00:16:23.198
<font face="Trebuchet MS">PCP?</font>

00:16:23.401 --> 00:16:25.699
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Es? Narkoba? Putaran?</font>

00:16:25.904 --> 00:16:28.065
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Oke. Seorang teman dan 'X' sudah cukup.</font>

00:16:30.475 --> 00:16:31.840
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Tentu.</font>

00:16:32.911 --> 00:16:36.438
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Kita ke gerbongku.
Akan kuambilkan beberapa.</font>

00:16:36.815 --> 00:16:38.043
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Bagaimana?</font>

00:16:39.384 --> 00:16:41.614
<font face="Trebuchet MS">- Bagaimana?
- Baiklah.</font>

00:16:51.897 --> 00:16:54.593
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Sial. Kau tahu apa?</font>

00:16:55.400 --> 00:16:59.131
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Sudah kucari tapi tidak bisa kutemukan.</font>

00:17:04.075 --> 00:17:06.908
<font face="Trebuchet MS">- Kau mau minum?
- Tidak.</font>

00:17:17.055 --> 00:17:18.147
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Hei, kau tahu apa?</font>

00:17:18.356 --> 00:17:21.484
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Tak apa, kami bisa mendapatkannya
di klub saat kami tiba di Praha.</font>

00:17:21.693 --> 00:17:23.627
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Tidak, tinggallah.</font>

00:17:25.363 --> 00:17:27.888
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Sudah kutemukan.</font>

00:17:33.338 --> 00:17:35.329
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Kau wangi sekali.</font>

00:17:37.609 --> 00:17:40.237
<font face="Trebuchet MS">- Kita harus pergi. Lorna menunggu.
- Ya, kami punya teman menunggu.</font>

00:17:40.445 --> 00:17:41.776
<font face="Trebuchet MS">- Kalian punya teman?
- Ya.</font>

00:17:41.980 --> 00:17:45.313
<font face="Trebuchet MS"><i>Satu, dua, tiga, sempurna.
Pas sekali, 'kan?</i></font>

00:17:48.887 --> 00:17:50.650
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Kami harus pergi,
jadi lupakan saja.</font>

00:17:50.855 --> 00:17:55.155
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Mau ke mana kau? Aku tahu
kalian cuma menggoda kami, dasar lonte.</font>

00:17:55.360 --> 00:17:56.657
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Kau panggil aku apa?</font>

00:17:56.861 --> 00:17:59.659
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Aku memanggilmu,
lonte bego Amerika!</font>

00:17:59.864 --> 00:18:01.024
<font face="Trebuchet MS">- Dasar keparat!
- Kau tahu apa?</font>

00:18:01.232 --> 00:18:04.724
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Kereta menuju Praha
ini panjang, jalang.</font>

00:18:04.936 --> 00:18:06.631
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Kami akan mencari kalian.</font>

00:18:07.272 --> 00:18:08.705
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Apa kau gila?</font>

00:18:08.907 --> 00:18:10.272
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Apa? Aku benci kata-kata itu.</font>

00:18:10.475 --> 00:18:12.807
<font face="Trebuchet MS">"Oh, lonte bego Amerika."
Aku kehilangan kesabaran.</font>

00:18:13.011 --> 00:18:15.275
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Oke, tapi ini tidak seperti
di kampus dan kau bisa...</font>

00:18:15.480 --> 00:18:18.074
<font face="Trebuchet MS">...memanggil ketua angkatan
lalu melaporkannya.</font>

00:18:23.088 --> 00:18:25.283
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Ya Tuhan. Lorna, apa yang terjadi?</font>

00:18:25.724 --> 00:18:27.658
