<font face="Trebuchet MS">12 Desember.</font>

01:25:35.984 --> 01:25:38.612
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Oh, ini gila.</font>

01:25:55.403 --> 01:25:56.836
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Apa-apaan? Tidak terbuka.</font>

01:25:58.640 --> 01:26:01.336
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Ini tidak terbuka!</font>

01:26:01.542 --> 01:26:03.407
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Oh, ya, tentu</font>

01:26:04.679 --> 01:26:07.705
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Dia tepat di belakangmu!
Bunuh dia!</font>

01:26:07.915 --> 01:26:10.713
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Bajingan! Tembak dia!</font>

01:26:11.052 --> 01:26:13.452
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Bunuh dia! Bunuh dia!</font>

01:26:16.724 --> 01:26:18.453
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Jangan tembak!
Hati-hati, demi Tuhan!</font>

01:26:18.660 --> 01:26:20.651
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Dia akan memotongnya!
Jangan tembak!</font>

01:26:20.862 --> 01:26:22.193
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Dia akan memotongnya!
Dia akan memotongnya!</font>

01:26:23.431 --> 01:26:24.762
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Panggilkan Sasha!</font>

01:26:24.999 --> 01:26:28.867
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Lakukan! Aku pelanggan di sini!
Lakukan, demi Tuhan!</font>

01:26:29.070 --> 01:26:30.901
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Astaga! Sialan!</font>

01:26:31.105 --> 01:26:32.163
<font face="Trebuchet MS">- Sasha!
- Bawa dia!</font>

01:26:50.024 --> 01:26:51.924
<font face="Trebuchet MS">- Tunggu! Akan kubeli kebebasanku.
- Tunggu!</font>

01:26:55.296 --> 01:26:58.288
<font face="Trebuchet MS">- Kau takkan mampu membayarnya.
- Jangan bilang aku tidak mampu.</font>

01:26:58.499 --> 01:27:02.663
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Tidak ada yang tidak mampu kubeli.
Aku bisa saja beli dan jual semua orang di ruangan ini!</font>

01:27:03.805 --> 01:27:06.000
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Kau akan menelepon
orang tuamu untuk minta uang?</font>

01:27:06.207 --> 01:27:08.300
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Tidak, keparat! Ini uangku!</font>

01:27:08.509 --> 01:27:11.501
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Beri saja aku PDA, nomor rekening,
dan penerimanya.</font>

01:27:11.713 --> 01:27:14.580
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Aku punya akun di Swiss,
Luksemburg, dan Islandia.</font>

01:27:14.782 --> 01:27:18.843
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Berikan saja harganya!
Percayalah, aku mampu!</font>

01:27:20.722 --> 01:27:22.246
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Baik.</font>

01:27:27.795 --> 01:27:28.921
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Kita nego.</font>

01:27:30.198 --> 01:27:33.031
<font face="Trebuchet MS">- Ini omong kosong!
- Ini bisnis.</font>

01:27:33.334 --> 01:27:34.392
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Akan kubayar lebih!</font>

01:27:34.836 --> 01:27:36.804
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Tidak dengan rumahmu
yang digadaikan...</font>

01:27:37.004 --> 01:27:39.063
<font face="Trebuchet MS">...dan tagihan sekolah
privat putrimu.</font>

01:27:39.540 --> 01:27:41.235
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Itu mengapa temanmu yang membayarkan.</font>

01:27:41.442 --> 01:27:43.307
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Berapa harganya?</font>

01:27:44.445 --> 01:27:46.845
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Uang bukan satu-satunya masalah.</font>

01:27:47.048 --> 01:27:48.675
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Kami punya kontrak di sini.</font>

01:27:49.484 --> 01:27:50.917
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Kontrak macam apa?</font>

01:27:52.386 --> 01:27:55.014
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Siapapun yang datang ke tempat ini...</font>

01:27:55.223 --> 01:27:56.850
<font face="Trebuchet MS">...tidak boleh pergi...</font>

01:27:57.058 --> 01:27:58.616
<font face="Trebuchet MS">...tanpa membunuh.</font>

01:27:59.560 --> 01:28:03.087
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Mereka tetap akan membunuhmu,
dasar kau lonte bego.</font>

01:28:04.499 --> 01:28:06.228
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Kau panggil aku apa?</font>

01:28:08.169 --> 01:28:10.967
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Kau lonte bodoh-!</font>

01:28:27.855 --> 01:28:29.220
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Biarkan dia mati kehabisan darah.</font>

01:28:30.992 --> 01:28:32.016
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Misha, tidak!</font>

01:29:12.633 --> 01:29:14.567
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Bukankah ini hebat?</font>

01:29:20.908 --> 01:29:23.172
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Hei, kembali ke sini!</font>

01:29:25.346 --> 01:29:26.540
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Tunggu!</font>

01:29:26.747 --> 01:29:28.647
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Tunggu! Tunggu!</font>

01:29:30.418 --> 01:29:31.510
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Tunggu!</font>

01:29:32.653 --> 01:29:33.620
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Hei!</font>

01:29:34.055 --> 01:29:36.649
<font face="Trebuchet MS">Kau keparat sialan! Tunggu!</font>

01:30:14.700 --> 01:30:34.700
